The '''accursed sceptre'''  is a [[powered staff]] requiring 70 [[Magic]] to wield. It is a direct upgrade of [[Thammaron's sceptre]], made with level 85 [[Crafting]] by using the [[Skull of Vet'ion]] on the Thammaron's sceptre (note that this process is reversible). Players without the required level to combine the items may ask [[Phabelle Bile]] in [[Ferox Enclave]] to do so instead, for a fee of 500,000 coins. The item counts as a [[Zamorak]]ian item in the [[God Wars Dungeon]]. Like most powered staves, it is only tradeable when it is fully uncharged.

Compared to [[Thammaron's sceptre]], the accursed sceptre has a higher max hit (usually +1 or +2 higher, depending on gear), +7 extra [[magic accuracy]], and a unique [[special attack]].

The sceptre also has a "Swap" option that allows players to switch it to an [[accursed sceptre (a)]], which is a variant that can [[autocast]] offensive [[combat spells]] from the [[standard spellbook]] (including [[Flames of Zamorak]]) and the [[Ancient Magicks]].

